# Shell scripts must stay LF. CRLF breaks bash on Windows (git-bash) checkouts.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Workflow and issue-template YAML stays LF. A Windows checkout that rewrites it
# to CRLF produces a whole-file diff for everyone with core.autocrlf off.
*.yml text eol=lf

# The /charts/ page: kept LF so edits never produce a whole-file diff.
server/charts-app/charts.html text eol=lf
# The envelope math file the page loads: LF too, so the bytes the server hashes match on every checkout.
server/charts-app/nwe-envelope.js text eol=lf
# The envelope's expected numbers, a byte-for-byte copy of the engine repo's file that a test checks
# by sha256: never convert its line endings.
scripts/fixtures/nwe_expected.v1.json -text
